	(text "IN1/IN2 -> OUT1/OUT2 = LEFT motor,   IN3/IN4 -> OUT3/OUT4 = RIGHT motor (+ = OUT4)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "05337a16-8e55-50aa-b774-03418dbc3866")
	)
	(text "Why rev.L4: 2 motors starting / stalled pull 2-4 A and the AA cells sag to 2.5-3.3 V; the XIAO needs about 4 V on its 5V pin and reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "14156922-36bc-5dd5-b9f1-14e083b8c323")
	)
	(text "The buzzer shares D4 with the START button (no free XIAO pin)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 327.66 176.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1d1bc3d0-b9e9-58dd-8ddf-1fb926bbdaf4")
	)
	(text "Power: AA x3 (alkaline 4.5V / NiMH 3.6V) -> VBAT (motors) ; VBAT -> D1 -> buck-boost 5.13 V -> D8 -> VSYS -> XIAO 5V pin. The XIAO no longer resets when the motors pull the cells down. Never use 4 cells (the module takes 5.5 V max)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1f3184af-0305-59c5-8e50-b3d328b910a2")
	)
	(text "U3 makes 5.13 V from 1.3-5.5 V (start 1.8 V).  VSYS = about 4.8 V (USB: 5 V).  No bulk capacitor on VSYS: it is USB VBUS (max 10 uF)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 77.47 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2514b929-de8c-51fd-9a8b-b1daeeaa2307")
	)
	(text "IR LED: (3.3V - 1.2V - 0.1V) / 100 ohm = about 20 mA each.  Q1 switches all LEDs (ambient light cancel).  Photo transistor: 10k pull-up -> white = low voltage, black = high voltage"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "278760e0-0dc5-5fe0-bd51-128236a3343a")
	)
	(text "LARGE=L : small mode (2 motors, 2A/ch)    MODE=L : IN/IN control"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 85.09 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
